  "referenceNumber": "RUS1071",
  "remarks": "\nAs a Belarusian producer of electronic warfare systems supplied to Russia and used in Russian military equipment, OBORONNYE INITSIATIVY has made available goods or technology to persons, including the Russian armed forces, that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
